@host = http://localhost:3000

### login kao klijent
# @name clientLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"marko@test.rs","password":"tajnalozinka"}

### lista tiketa (klijent — samo svoje) — 200
GET {{host}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{clientLogin.response.body.token}}

### lista bez tokena — 401
GET {{host}}/api/tickets

### login kao agent
# @name agentLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"agent@test.rs","password":"tajnalozinka"}


### lista tiketa (agent — sve) — 200
GET {{host}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{agentLogin.response.body.token}}

### uploaduj tiket - 201
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientLogin.response.body.token}}

{"title" : "New Ticket", "description" : "Need help with my pc"}


### uploaduj tiket (bez tokena) - 401
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{"title" : "New Ticket", "description" : "Need help with my pc"}

### uploaduj prazno telo — 400
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientLogin.response.body.token}}

### uploaduj tiket sa status i createdBy — 201, ali ignorisano (status ostaje "open" po defaultu - createdBy je id korisnika)
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientLogin.response.body.token}}

{"title":"Hakerski tiket","description":"Probam mass assignment","status":"resolved","createdBy":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"}